#: ../../../how-to/expose-apps.rst:3
msgid "Expose apps"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/expose-apps.rst:5
msgid ""
"Control which apps and manual pages an environment links onto your ``PATH``, "
"without rebuilding it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/expose-apps.rst:9
msgid "Hide an app"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/expose-apps.rst:11
msgid ""
"Use ``unexpose`` when another command with the same name should win, but you "
"want to keep the environment:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/expose-apps.rst:13
msgid "$ pipx unexpose ansible"
msgstr "$ pipx unexpose ansible"

#: ../../../how-to/expose-apps.rst:17
msgid ""
"pipx removes the apps and manual pages recorded for that environment from "
"its global directories. Upgrade and reinstall keep it hidden, and injected "
"apps stay hidden too."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/expose-apps.rst:22
msgid "Restore an app"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/expose-apps.rst:24
msgid "$ pipx expose ansible"
msgstr "$ pipx expose ansible"

#: ../../../how-to/expose-apps.rst:28
msgid ""
"pipx relinks each recorded app and manual page without rebuilding the "
"environment."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/expose-apps.rst:32
msgid "Expose a dependency's apps"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/expose-apps.rst:34
msgid ""
"A dependency's apps are not exposed by default. Select them at install time."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/expose-apps.rst:36
msgid "``--include-deps`` exposes apps and manual pages from every dependency:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/expose-apps.rst:38
msgid "$ pipx install nox --include-deps"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/expose-apps.rst:42
msgid ""
"``--include-resources-from PACKAGE`` exposes resources from one dependency; "
"repeat it to select more:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/expose-apps.rst:44
msgid "$ pipx install \"nox[tox_to_nox]\" --include-resources-from tox"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/expose-apps.rst:48
msgid ""
"pipx records the selection so upgrade and reinstall preserve it. The install "
"fails and rolls back when a selected package is not a dependency that ships "
"apps or manual pages. Both options also work on ``pipx inject``; see :doc:"
"`inject-packages`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/expose-apps.rst:54
msgid ""
"``--include-apps-from`` was renamed to ``--include-resources-from``. pipx "
"still reads the old name from metadata written by earlier versions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/expose-apps.rst:59
msgid "Verify it"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/expose-apps.rst:61
msgid "$ pipx list"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/expose-apps.rst:65
msgid ""
"The exposed apps appear under their environment. Run one to confirm it "
"resolves on your ``PATH``."
msgstr ""
